{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia walks in looking for Heki","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:18:00.130000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744334106841579530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"waves happily \"So you got my message?  I need you to know the limitations of the tiny hut spell I will be using.  After that I have a plan I need some advice on\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:18:57.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744334347561074830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Alright.\" She takes a seat at the bar","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:19:45.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744334547809992776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"he goes behind the bar and pulls out two glasses \"First and most importantly, only 9 creatures can be in the hut.  There is no cheating extras in.  If we try to create it with more, it will fail.  likewise if we create extras while in it, it will fail.  So if people want their pets at the site, they will have to keep them out.  That also means, for each of the 8 hour shifts, it will be me, you, and no more than 7 people.  There is no tagging in.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:21:49.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744335068373188752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I plan to be with you all 24 hours.  I will sleep in the first hut, then create one, 8 hours later, and 2 ontop of each other 8 hours after that..\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:22:33.279000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744335252511785052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"No drink for me please. I can't before the ritual.\" She pauses processing the information \"That makes sense. So if we are in the hut, what are we safe from?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:24:12.251000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744335667630178307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"nearly everything.  that brings me to my third point.  the hut protects all that is inside from nearly anything, but can be dispelled, wished away, and I am sure a few other things.  We can go in and out, and throw objects out, but no new spells will be able to pass its barrier in either direction.  So I have to wait for the moment after you start, and right before you finish I will remove them.  If they don't destroy the huts, we cannot be harmed while in them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:28:10.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744336665606094858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Its not a sure thing, but its as close as we can get.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:29:05.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744336898503344150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"That will be incredibly helpful!\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:29:10.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744336920615714891","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Furthermore, If we see trouble, I can step out of the hut, and write a message in the sky calling for aid from town.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:29:49.812000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-15T23:30:00.730000Z","id":"744337083463761970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"For a majority of the ritual I will be sitting in the same spot, the center of the area I will casting over. However there will be a few moments when I will need to walk the perimeter of the land. That will most likely me the dangerous part of it all.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:31:22.793000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744337473454211142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I can have people around me, but my path shouldn't be blocked and I can't be stopped.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:31:56.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744337613946748968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I understand.  Which gets me to something important.  I am not a hero.  I am no warrior.  When you leave the hut, I will be staying behind.  I inspire hero's to greatness, but am not one to seek greatness myself.  Outside of that hut, in a fight, I am a hinderance.  But I can still write to town if i see trouble from within the bubble.  I need you to understand my place in this\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:34:19.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744338216513175623","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"(this is his way of allowing you to ask for insp when you leave the hut)","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:34:47.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744338331340374126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"You are doing what you can. Others will be there. Skilled fighters. You are there to provide a safe space for us, and give us support. It is already a great help.\" She smiles \"and who says heros have to fight?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:36:20.511000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744338722174009404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"laughs \"most of the stories like the ones that can.  Now for my next bit, a plan I have against the hunger.  Do you remember Luna?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:37:16.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744338958091157635","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She nods \"How could I forget.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:38:16.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744339209502064640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Where I can not fight, I can talk.  I can move people with the strongest magic of all.  Words.  What would you say, if I told you, I may be able to convince her to aid us in the fight against the hunger?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:39:10.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744339434228416519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Then I would be greatful in your ability to give this community allies. It is something they have struggled with.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:40:14.764000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-15T23:40:28.423000Z","id":"744339704702566461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I have an open invite to talk to her, as long as I go unarmed.  May words are more powerful than swords, so that is an easy request.  But its possible she may just eat me.  Going alone, like I was asked to do, may break our first law.  Now I repeat, should I ask her aid?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:42:01.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744340153723781171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She thinks for a moment. \"I think if you do go alone, you should talk to one of the leaders. Copper has been working hard to try and give us the aid we need, perhaps he will give you a pass knowing the nature of the meeting.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:44:00.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744340650408935456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"A few could be on standby in the outskits waiting for your signal for help if you need it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:44:36.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744340800422543360","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Good Idea.  My plan will have to wait for your plan to be done anyway.  One last thing\" he pauses waiting to be acknowledged","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:46:02.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744341165201031228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
